WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/driving/components/drivetrain-health/TemperatureGauges.tsx — a presentational leaf fed
  { sensors: TempSensor[] } by the Drivetrain Health page (DrivetrainHealthPage.tsx), plus useUnits()
  (unitPrefs.temperature ∈ {°C,°F}). One GlassPanel(p-6) with a Thermometer <h3> header
  t('drivetrain.tempGauges','Temperature Gauges') over a Grid(cols 2 / md 4). Per sensor:
    RadialGauge( value = sensor.value !== null ? convertTempFromSI(value) : 0,
                 max   = convertTempFromSI(maxTemp),
                 label = t(sensor.labelKey, sensor.defaultLabel),
                 unit  = unitPrefs.temperature,
                 color = tempSeverityColor(sensor.value, sensor.maxTemp) )
    + <p> "Max: {fmtNumber(convertTempFromSI(maxTemp),0)}{unit}"  (t('drivetrain.maxLabel','Max')).
  RadialGauge centre = fmtNumber(clamp(value,0,max), Number.isInteger(clamped)?0:getGlobalPrecision()) + unit;
  ring fill = clamped/max. helpers.tempSeverityColor: null→#6b7280(gray); ratio = celsius/max (SI):
  ≥0.85 critical #ef4444, ≥0.65 warning #f59e0b, else good #10b981. convertTempFromSI: °C passes through,
  °F = c*9/5+32. Real sensors (DrivetrainHealthPage): frontMotor/rearMotor maxTemp 150, inverter 120, battery 60.
  Data hooks: useTranslation, useUnits. The parent owns loading/error; this leaf renders sensors only.

