PARITY NOTES (numbers/units verified by tests)
  • °C content: front 95→"95"/fill 95/150/normal, rear 110→warning, inverter 105/120→critical, battery 34→normal.
  • °F content: 95°C→"203°F", ceiling 150°C→"302°F"; ring fill uses display °F (203/302) while severity stays on
    the SI ratio (95/150 → normal) — the exact web split (RadialGauge fill on display, tempSeverityColor on SI).
  • null reading → centre "0", fill 0, neutral (gray) tone, ceiling still shown (web passes literal 0).
  • reading above ceiling clamps centre + fill; non-integer °F (34°C→"93.20") uses global precision 2; ceiling 0 dp.
  • States: loading skeleton / empty / error+retry / stale chip+auto-refresh / offline cached chip + banner / content.

STATE-HOLDER + TELEMETRY + I18N + A11Y (predecessor seams)
  • P1/S8 : view binds a `TemperatureGaugesSource` (onUpdate/start/stop/refresh); no HTTP in the view. Model resolves
            phase (loading/empty/error/content), recomputes the projection, and does one guarded stale auto-refresh.
  • P1/S11: model.start() emits view.opened surface="TemperatureGauges" exactly once (asserted).
  • P1/S10: every string via TemperatureGaugesStrings facade (NSLocalizedString table "TemperatureGauges"); 0 literals
            in the view. Parity keys drivetrain.tempGauges / drivetrain.maxLabel present.
  • A11y  : each gauge cell is one VoiceOver element ("Front Motor 95°C, Max 150°C"); ring honours Reduce Motion;
            Dynamic Type via tokenised fonts; the grid combines into one surface summary.

